     1,
     "Dear All,<div><br></div><div>I found the answer :-)</div><div><br></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1f497d\">shop&lt;-c(&#39;E1&#39;,&#39;E2&#39;,&#39;E3&#39;,&#39;E3&#39;,&#39;E3&#39;,&#39;E4&#39;,&#39;E4&#39;,&#39;E5&#39;,&#39;E6&#39;,&#39;E6&#39;,&#39;E7&#39;)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1f497d\">address&lt;-c(&#39;A1&#39;,&#39;A2&#39;,&#39;A3&#39;,&#39;A4&#39;,&#39;A5&#39;,&#39;A4&#39;,&#39;A6&#39;,&#39;A7&#39;,&#39;A3&#39;,&#39;A5&#39;,&#39;A8&#39;)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1f497d\">example &lt;- as.data.frame(cbind(shop,address))<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1f497d\">example &lt;- transform(example, rank =\r\nave(rep(NA, nrow(example)), example$shop, FUN = seq_along))<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1f497d\">result &lt;-\r\nreshape(example,idvar=&quot;shop&quot;,timevar=&quot;rank&quot;,direction=&quot;wide&quot;)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">result<u></u><u></u></span></p>Regards,</div><div><br></div><div>Thomas</div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
